   104	/// minecraft.wiki "Lantern": "To place a lantern on top of a block, aim at the block's top
   105	/// face, and press use. To hang a lantern from the bottom of a block, aim at the block's
   106	/// bottom face, and press use." and "Pressing use on the top half of the adjacent block will
   107	/// hang the lantern from the bottom of an above block, and pressing use on the bottom half of
   108	/// the adjacent block will place the lantern down on the top face of a bottom block."
   109	///
