     6	//!   brain runtime knows about. `DoNothing`, `GateBehavior`/`RunOne` and the declarative
     7	//!   one-shots implement it directly, exactly as they do in Java.
     8	//! - [`TimedBehavior`] + [`TimedBehaviorControl`] together are `Behavior<E>`
