    13	//!   keeps the lifecycle in exactly one place without the coherence fight.
    14	//!
    15	//! The trait is deliberately **synchronous**. Everything a behavior in this stage touches --
    16	//! `Navigator::set_progress`, `LookControl`, atomics on `Entity` -- is sync, so there is no way
